  _sentence:
    CharacterName: High Priest
    Text: 'who could have thought they were capable of this? And you are sure it
      is them? Well you are the chronicler and if we do not bring someone in, the
      other nobles will grow restless and start accusing each other for their personal
      gain. Very well, Nikolaus. I can only hope you are correct in this. '
    CharacterSprite: {fileID: 0}
